module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.a_child_peak_resident_inherits_the_predecessor_address_space

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { BlockerClassUnstated, RecurringFailureMode, RungUnread }

data a_child_peak_resident_inherits_the_predecessor_address_space: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "a_child_peak_resident_inherits_the_predecessor_address_space" as NonEmptyStr,
  rung: RungUnread { cause: BlockerClassUnstated },

  receipts: [
    "INVALID STATE: a peak resident figure read from ru_maxrss (wait4 on a child, or getrusage RUSAGE_SELF inside a process that was itself spawned) is taken as the subject's own peak while Linux seeds it, at exec, from the high-water mark of the address space the exec replaced. A process spawned straight from a large parent therefore reports the parent's peak, however small the process is.",
    "HARM: a Measured space fact that is not the subject's. A tiny child under a large parent reads the parent's size, so a memory baseline, an admission limit derived from it, or a witness that asserts only that a peak exists passes on a number belonging to someone else, and the contamination moves with the parent's size rather than the subject's, so it looks like a measurement.",
    "DISTINGUISHING FACTS: the figure equals the parent's own peak to the byte for BOTH a one-module control and the real workload (gunbc#13857 first run: 17,377,333,248 B for a 1.5 ms control and the census, the seed's emission peak). The control is the discriminator: a reading that does not order control below workload is the parent's. getrusage RUSAGE_CHILDREN is worse, folding in every reaped child, cargo and rustc included. /proc/self/status VmHWM is the new address space's own high-water and is not inherited.",
    "RUNG FOUND AT: mitigatable - found by the control refusing a real run (gunbc#13857), fixed for that one reader by spawning the native binary through a trampoline (the seed re-entered at the top of gunbc test, small address space) so the wait4 rusage is the child's. The self readers (cli_run peak_rss_vhwm_bytes, so observed_peak_resident_bytes, claim_batch peak lines and the pre-entry max_rss_kib line) read RUSAGE_SELF and were unprotected until the audit that filed this row; peak_rss_vhwm_bytes now reads VmHWM on Linux, guarded by the execution control cli_run tests peak_rss_vhwm_bytes_is_not_the_spawning_parents.",
    "CEILING: mechanically preventable - ru_maxrss is a kernel-seeded quantity the model cannot make unwritable, and a spawned process cannot be forbidden from having a large parent. What can be modeled is the reading's provenance: which source (VmHWM, cgroup memory.peak, trampolined wait4) a Measured space fact came from. Authority: extdeps.posix.rusage and extdeps.linux.rusage model the unit and not the inheritance.",
    "AUDIT AT FILING (grep peak_resident_measured_witness, ru_maxrss, wait4, getrusage, RUSAGE_CHILDREN): cli_run measure_root_demand wait4 - not affected, the parent spawns before any compile so its pre-spawn peak is small, but valid only while that holds. native_lane_runner measured_spawn_trampoline - fixed by gunbc#13857. cli_run peak_rss_vhwm_bytes and its callers (v1_interpreter observed_peak_resident_bytes, claim_batch peak_rss_bytes, main.rs pre-entry max_rss_kib) - affected whenever the process is spawned from a large one (claim_executor and required_floor_runner spawn their own executable), fixed here. claim_batch children_max_rss_bytes - RUSAGE_CHILDREN in a process that spawns nothing in claim_batch itself, not an inheritance case; folds whatever it reaped, left. dag/test/claim/peak_resident_measured_witness - asserts peak > 0 only, so it could not have caught contamination; the Rust control carries that obligation.",
    "NEXT-RUNG TRIGGER: a Measured space fact carries its source as a typed field (std.realization_measurement ResidencyObservation naming VmHWM / cgroup memory.peak / trampolined child) and a consumer refuses an ru_maxrss figure without the trampoline or an own-address-space source - the capability restored is provenance-carrying residency readings; today the choice of source is a code-review fact. macOS inheritance behavior of ru_maxrss across exec is unverified and the Darwin arm still reads getrusage.",
  ],
  evidence: [],
}
